0,4146400,8424900,2256300,16589300,3859400,1512300,1314000,10199000,6150600,2626700,5764700,997500,565300,34724800,30099500,20360300,12587500,13472000,5450800,210000,562600,4206300,464500,476300,328800,3064000,650200,1273200,776100,688900,1719300,5106400,5564100,702000,403000,290200,209800,1980900,872600,2578400,233700,1654500]}},"profile":{"website":"https://mieco.com.my","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Lumber & Wood Production","employees":305,"city":"Cheras","summary":"Mieco Berhad, an investment holding company, engages in the manufacture and sale of wood-based products in Malaysia, Hong Kong, China, and internationally. The company manufactures and distributes particle boards, melamine faced chipboards, medium density fibreboards, and solid rubberwood products. It also offers high pressure laminate, rubberwood raw material, and wooded pellets, as well as chipboards related products. In addition, the company is involved in the provision of management services, as well as manufacturing and trading of moulded timber, furniture products, and timber treatment processing. Further, it engages in wholesale of logs, sawn timber; plywood, veneer and related products; manufacturing of other chemical products; and wholesale of lumber and timber, as well as invests in property. It also exports its products. The company was formerly known as Mieco Chipboard Berhad and changed its name to Mieco Berhad in June 2026. Mieco Berhad was incorporated in 1972 and is headquartered in Cheras, Malaysia.","zh":"Mieco Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，主要从事木制产品的制造与销售，业务覆盖马来西亚、香港、中国及国际市场。公司前身为 Mieco Chipboard Berhad，于 2026 年 6 月更名为 Mieco Berhad，1972 年注册成立，总部位于马来西亚 Cheras。","lines":["刨花板与人造板：制造和分销刨花板、三聚氰胺贴面刨花板、中密度纤维板及相关刨花板产品。","实木橡胶木产品：生产实木橡胶木制品，并提供橡胶木原材料。","高压层压板与木颗粒：提供高压层压板及木颗粒产品。","木材加工与家具：从事模压木材、家具产品的制造与贸易，以及木材处理加工。","原木与木材贸易：批发原木、锯材、胶合板、单板及相关产品，并批发木材与木料。","管理与投资：提供管理服务，并从事物业投资。"],"lines_en":["Particle board and panel products: Manufactures and distributes particle boards, melamine faced chipboards, medium density fibreboards, and related chipboard products.","Solid rubberwood products: Produces solid rubberwood products and offers rubberwood raw material.","High pressure laminate and wood pellets: Offers high pressure laminate and wooded pellets.","Timber processing and furniture: Manufactures and trades moulded timber and furniture products, and provides timber treatment processing.","Log and timber trading: Wholesales logs, sawn timber, plywood, veneer and related products, and wholesales lumber and timber.","Management and investment: Provides management services and invests in property."]}}